ance of the pool and user based on `_amount` Emits a {LogDepositToPool} event Requirements: - can only be called by SMASP contract - rewardPool for `_assetId` must be in phase I - reward period for phase I must not have completed already","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Assset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"getPendingRewards(uint256,address)":{"details":"Fetches the pending rewards of a user w.r.t. a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Address of an user"}},"getPhaseInfo(uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the state of a phase in PMC","params":{"_phase":": Phase number(1 or 2) in PMC"}},"getRewardPoolInfo(uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the information of an asset reward pool in PMC","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"getUserPoolInfo(address,uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the information of a user w.r.t. a reward pool in PMC","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Address of an user"}},"massUpdatePoolRewardVariables(uint256[],uint256)":{"details":"Updates all the reward variables of reward pools in a given phase","params":{"_assetIds":": Array of assetId of all reward pools currently in `_phase`","_phase":": phase for which all reward pools are getting mass-updated Called whenever a new reward pool is added to the PMC {Func: addRewardPool} OR  the allocPoint for an existing reward pool is updated {Func: updateRewardPoolAllocations} This is because the rewards for all pools is affected by the above two actions"}},"paused()":{"details":"Returns true if the contract is paused, and false otherwise."},"setRewardEmissionRate(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Lets the owner update the emissionRate for a phase in PMC","params":{"_phase":": one of the two global phases of reward pools in PMC","_rewardEmissionRate":": amount of vouchers (`_phase` == 1) or  silent rewards (`_phase` == 2) to be distributed per second in PMC Emits the event {LogUpdateRewardEmissionRate} denoting the newly updated reward emission rate for the `_phase` Requirement: Owner will need to update all the reward pools with the  function: {massupdatePoolRewardVariables} beforehand"}},"stakeSilentToPool(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-stakeSilentToPool}","params":{"_amount":": Amount of Silent tokens to be staked Lets user stake their Silent tokens to a reward pool - _amount cannot be zero - reward pool must be in phase 2 - the current reward period shouldn't have completed - the contract must be in unpaused state - the user must have participated in phase 1 of the reward pool:   UserPoolState.phase should not be zero - the user must have collected voucher rewards in phase 1 Updates the balance of user and the pool based on `_amount` Emits a {LogSilentStakedToPool} event indicating the staked amount","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool"}},"unstakeSilentFromPool(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-unstakeSilentFromPool}","params":{"_amount":": Amount of Silent tokens to be unstaked Lets user(caller) unstake their Silent tokens from a reward pool Requirements - reward pool must be in phase 2 - `_amount` cannot be less than user's total stake in the pool - user must be in phase 2 for the given reward pool Updates the balance of user and the pool based on `_amount` powered by user's total voucher balance Transfers `_amount` Silent tokens from contract to the user Emits a {LogSilentUnstakedFromPool} event indicating the updated balance","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool"}},"updateRewardPoolAllocations(uint256,uint256,uint8)":{"details":"Lets the owner update the allocation points for a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": assetId of the reward pool","_newAllocPoint":": reward allocation point for the reward pool Updates the reward pool variables Emits the event {LogUpdateRewardPool} denoting the _assetId and _newAllocPoint of the rewardPool Requirements: - reward pool's phase 